  "ethnobotanical_info": "An attractive palm native to the Baja Peninsula of Mexico, this palm is now a popular ornamental throughout the tropics. Recent research shows the pruning waste of the large fronds to be suitable for particleboard production. (Garcia-Ortuño et al., 2013)",
